# MonitorBot

- Source of truth: `TZ-telegram-monitor-bot.md` and `.cursor/skills/telegram-monitor-bot/SKILL.md`
- Stack MVP: Python 3.11+, Telethon (monitor) + aiogram (commands/notify), SQLite
- Matching MVP: Contains, case-insensitive only until Sprint 2 is stable
- Secrets only in `.env` (never commit tokens/sessions)
- Do not over-engineer before Sprint 2 MVP is complete
- Bot UI language: Russian (per TZ)
- Keep Telethon user client and aiogram bot separated
